{"ok":true,"name":"Hanuman Ansh","desc":"After the death of his mother, a young boy leaves his home in grief, believing that only by finding God can he meet her again. His search takes him across temples, forests, rivers and villages, where he lives in silence, discipline and devotion, slowly shedding all attachments. Through years of wandering and inner struggle, he discovers that God is not found in escape from the world, but in serving it. As his compassion grows, so do stories of quiet miracles, healing, and grace. Renouncing identity and ownership, the boy transforms into Hanuman Ansh, Neem Karoli Baba, dedicating his life to feeding the hungry, loving all without distinction, and blessing humanity through humility, service and silent faith.","year":2026,"rating":9,"ratingCount":2,"thumb":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ts7wUcu3QPG9o0gDMoSLN6VQnNb.jpg","servers":[{"name":"Server 1","src":"https://videm.xyz/embed/movie/tt39390582&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 2","src":"https://vidapi.xyz/embed/movie/1709391"},{"name":"Server 3","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vnest?tmdb=1709391&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 4","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vcr?tmdb=1709391&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 5","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vpls?tmdb=1709391&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 6","src":"https://embedmaster.link/movie/tt39390582"},{"name":"Server 7","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vesy?tmdb=1709391&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 8","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vsrc?imdb=tt39390582"}],"genres":["Family"],"seasons":null,"duration":"PT2H30M","imdb":"tt39390582","related":[{"id":499338,"slug":"i-believe","title":"I Believe","type":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DVRR21ol8EojJxAlaNcLTzLBvI.jpg"},{"id":743439,"slug":"paw-patrol-jet-to-the-rescue","title":"PAW Patrol: Jet to the Rescue","type":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHcn3PbjVHxBweDZxWpYH3JfugS.jpg"},{"id":785522,"slug":"skater-girl","title":"Skater Girl","typ